Package: fingerprint-fix-sdcp
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         galaxybook-fingerprint-manager (= ${binary:Version}),
         fprintd,
         libfprint-2-2,
         usbutils,
         systemd
Description: Egis fingerprint reader driver for Samsung Galaxy Book (egismoc SDCP)
 Makes the Egis match-on-chip fingerprint reader (1c7a:05a5 on Galaxy Book 4 /
 Book 5 Pro, 1c7a:05a1 on Book 4) work on Linux. Builds only the
 egismoc SDCP driver of libfprint and points fprintd at it; the distro's
 libfprint is not replaced.
 .
 Comes with the Galaxy Book Fingerprint Manager (galaxybook-fingerprint-manager).
 Removing this package alone switches fprintd back to the distro's libfprint
 and keeps the Manager.

Package: galaxybook-fingerprint-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         fprintd,
         libfprint-2-2,
         libpam-fprintd,
         libglib2.0-bin,
         libnotify-bin,
