         python3-gi-cairo,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
         gir1.2-fprint-2.0
Replaces: fingerprint-fix-sdcp (<< 2.0.0~)
Breaks: fingerprint-fix-sdcp (<< 2.0.0~)
Description: Galaxy Book Fingerprint Manager, with boot-time and login checks
 Test, enrol, export / import and tidy fingerprints on the Samsung Galaxy
 Book's Egis fingerprint reader, with a monitor and boot-time check that warn
 when the sensor loses a fingerprint (e.g. after booting Windows).
 .
 Works with fingerprint-fix-sdcp's driver, or with the distro's own libfprint
 once it has SDCP support for the reader.
